1
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:17,540
Aiming for a certain day
floating on the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:24,660
when I kick a pebble, even my shoes fly off.

3
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:33,000
Onto the head of the carpenter
I was putting in a choke hold,

4
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:39,140
they laughed that I was still just a brat.

5
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:44,220
Even if I somehow stir up some energy,

6
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:49,000
passion, a little yawn,
nothing so urgent gets used.

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,160
The streetscape is strangely gentle.

8
00:00:54,660 --> 00:01:01,140
From the pointed hat's water canteen,

9
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:07,440
great shaku heaven, the setting sun falls.

10
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:15,920
Why does tomorrow have to end too

11
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:21,020
Katsushika Shibamata, happiness is lost too.

12
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:24,700
Because I'm a fool who only
realized it after listening.

13
00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:55,320
We at Kuitaore are a general restaurant
with chain locations all over Japan.

14
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:58,620
We have everything, so you'll never
be stuck for something to order.

15
00:01:58,620 --> 00:02:00,620
And of course, we deliver everything too.

16
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:04,980
That's truly a relief, isn't it, Chief?

17
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:07,940
We've always been having
trouble at lunchtime.

18
00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:11,160
Our station alone will surely eat most of it,
no doubt.

19
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:15,880
Yes, but our branch has only just opened,
and the lack of staff is our biggest worry.

20
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:18,480
Every place has the same staff shortage,
doesn't it.

21
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:21,320
Especially in the delivery department,
we're short-handed.

22
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,820
What do you think, Ohara?

23
00:02:22,820 --> 00:02:24,460
Do you have any idea
who might be behind this?

24
00:02:24,460 --> 00:02:25,460
Understood.

25
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:28,340
I'll keep an eye out during
our community patrol visits.

26
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:29,120
Thank you very much.

27
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,180
Not at all.

28
00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:34,800
Serving the residents is our duty,
after all.

29
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,280
We're neighbors, aren't we?

30
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:38,260
When times are tough,
we help each other out.

31
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,640
Thanks to Tabeodore-san's place,

32
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:43,640
we can make good use of our work hours too.

33
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:46,680
Hard, hard.

34
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:51,340
Yahoo! I finally got it!

35
00:02:51,700 --> 00:02:52,880
Ohara-kun!

36
00:02:53,780 --> 00:02:56,880
What is that idiot doing!

37
00:02:57,180 --> 00:02:59,960
Wow, it's Denno Senki Zeksaado!

38
00:03:00,260 --> 00:03:02,060
You managed to get it!

39
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:04,720
Every place was sold out,
and I'd already given up!

40
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:07,480
Wow! Amazing!

41
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:11,360
Unbelievable. I thought you left this morning,
but you went out to buy this kind of thing?

42
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:15,820
Yeah, someone said they saw one
at the kerosene shop in Hachioji.

43
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:19,600
Somehow I managed to get it.

44
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:22,580
Senpai, what's that model kit?
Is it a freebie?

45
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:24,860
That's the biggest selling
point of the Zekuso Hard.

46
00:03:24,860 --> 00:03:27,340
There's a data chip built inside it,

47
00:03:27,340 --> 00:03:32,800
and when you connect it to a game console like that,
you can control the same robot from the model as the real machine.

48
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:35,940
Ryo-san, let's hurry up and play a match!

49
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:36,900
You're in, right?

50
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:39,460
Alright, wait there,
I'll build it right away.

51
00:03:41,660 --> 00:03:42,460
Wow, that's amazing!

52
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:43,300
That was fast!

53
00:03:44,060 --> 00:03:46,000
This is a piece of cake, a piece of cake!

54
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,280
Separa!

55
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,820
Alright, it's done!

56
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,480
What's the big idea, all of a sudden?

57
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:52,580
Chief!

58
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:56,360
Playing with toys like that on duty?
You've got it made, don't you?

59
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:58,140
Come on, Chief.

60
00:03:58,140 --> 00:04:02,300
I'm just valuing my interaction with the citizens,
you see.

61
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,460
Chief, what is it?

62
00:04:04,460 --> 00:04:07,360
Do you really think an
excuse like that will work?

63
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,820
Please stop it, Chief!

64
00:04:08,820 --> 00:04:10,900
Shut up, this is being confiscated!

65
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:12,420
Senpai had some business to take care of, so

66
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:14,620
Mom's

67
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:19,180
Apparently she rode her bike all the way
to Hachioji just to buy that from Ryo-chan.

68
00:04:19,180 --> 00:04:19,680
What?

69
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:22,480
Reiko, you little snitch,
how dare you tell on me!

70
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:24,320
Are you the budget or something, you idiot?

71
00:04:24,460 --> 00:04:38,560
Uuuuuuuuuugh...

72
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,487
Come on, Chief,

73
00:04:39,537 --> 00:04:42,960
that has nothing to do with police work!

74
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:47,420
Don't worry, I'll ask the station chief
to make it paid leave as a special case.

75
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:49,280
Senpai, do I still have any paid leave left?

76
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,260
Of course there's no such thing!

77
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:57,100
Chief Ohara told us all about you.

78
00:04:57,100 --> 00:04:59,740
That Chief really went and chewed me out.

79
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:03,360
This is the delivery center
where you'll be working.

80
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:07,780
What is this?

81
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:11,060
It looks like a dispatch center!

82
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:28,300
Kameari 4-chome direction, ready.

83
00:05:28,300 --> 00:05:28,880
Roger.

84
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:31,500
Wow, it really is a restaurant.

85
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:34,040
Beyond here is the delivery
staff's waiting room.

86
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:37,560
What, it's a room like an eel's bed.

87
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,580
Am I the one going to the station?

88
00:05:42,740 --> 00:05:44,780
You know the inside of the station best.

89
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:46,700
Well, that's true, but...

90
00:05:46,700 --> 00:05:48,660
Please wait at seat 13.

91
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:49,720
Got it.

92
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,320
Nice to work with you.

93
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:54,020
So that's it.

94
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:57,040
It's awfully cramped.

95
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:59,720
Please take the delivery slips.

96
00:06:00,500 --> 00:06:01,300
Yeah, this is it.

97
00:06:01,300 --> 00:06:04,220
Delivery 13, standing by to depart.

98
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:19,380
This is like a secret
base from a robot anime!

99
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,800
Delivery number 13, take off!

100
00:06:47,060 --> 00:06:47,200
Yay!

101
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:50,420
Yay!

102
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,280
Yay!

103
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:54,920
Ryo-san!

104
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,540
It's a Tabedaruma delivery!

105
00:07:00,380 --> 00:07:01,960
Alright! It's Tabedaruma!

106
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,140
Where's the ramen... still...

107
00:07:05,140 --> 00:07:07,240
Hey, ramen over here! Hurry up!

108
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,320
Put it here, here!

109
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:09,680
Here you go, try not to spill it!

110
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:11,600
Here you go! Your ramen's ready!

111
00:07:12,220 --> 00:07:13,400
Ryo-san!

112
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:13,960
Bah!

113
00:07:13,980 --> 00:07:18,100
That's the punishment for an idiot who acted
high and mighty over a single bowl of ramen!

114
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,820
Where's the finished ramen?

115
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:20,800
Here! That's me!

116
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,180
I'll take it myself!

117
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:23,360
Really?

118
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:26,260
It's only natural to do this much!

119
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:29,200
This is easy!

120
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:01,240
What do you want, you barbarian!

121
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:02,540
I can't believe this!

122
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:04,820
Shut up! Next, three ramen!

123
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,000
Next, fried rice!

124
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:10,600
Snack time, your highness!
How do you like that

125
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,360
Here you go! Seeber!

126
00:08:14,580 --> 00:08:15,940
Hey! Here you are!

127
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:18,280
Ugh! You'll regret this!

128
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,080
I'm telling Chief Ohara on you!

129
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,160
Yes, sorry about that.

130
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:26,980
A katsudon in the interrogation room,
just like a detective drama.

131
00:08:27,100 --> 00:08:28,060
Be careful, will you!

132
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:29,960
Excuse me for intruding.

133
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,860
Yo, Ryo-san.

134
00:08:32,260 --> 00:08:33,680
Tell us the name of your accomplice.

135
00:08:34,060 --> 00:08:35,140
I don't know.

136
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:36,580
There definitely must be one, so spill it.

137
00:08:36,580 --> 00:08:38,500
I told you I don't know.

138
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:40,860
Here's your cutlet bowl,
one interrogation special.

139
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,480
Thanks for your hard work.

140
00:08:42,940 --> 00:08:46,160
Come on, eat this cutlet bowl
and you'll change your mind.

141
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,040
Do you think I'd eat something
that looks this disgusting?

142
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,040
Hey, you!

143
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:53,460
Hey,

144
00:08:53,460 --> 00:08:57,120
are you really going to find
fault with what I brought?

145
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,480
What the hell are you doing, you bastard?

146
00:08:59,060 --> 00:08:59,820
Figures, it's Ryo-san.

147
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:00,400
It's bad.

148
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,260
Shut the hell up!

149
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:01,960
Whoa!

150
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:02,960
Don't get in my way!

151
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:07,140
Let's have you eat it
and see if it's really bad!

152
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,600
Just try eating it!

153
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:10,860
Hey, eat the zaru!

154
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,980
There's still miso soup and takuan left!

155
00:09:13,180 --> 00:09:15,040
Hey, that's going a bit too far, Ryo-san.

156
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:17,900
You've held out so long,
you can't even taste it anymore, can you?

157
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,500
Hey, help me, Kankichi-san!

158
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:21,760
Come on, just let it go at that, Ryo-san.

159
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:23,440
There's some left in that bowl!

160
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:25,400
And don't name all your accomplices.

161
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:26,820
Somebody do something about that guy.

162
00:09:27,660 --> 00:09:29,480
Pay for the bowls you broke!

163
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:31,000
Got it, got it, Ryo-san!

164
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:35,160
Ugh, try putting yourself in the shoes of
the people who have to deliver this, dammit.

165
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:37,800
Yo! Feast-till-you-drop delivery!

166
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:41,160
Nobody's here.

167
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:43,480
Where's the order?

168
00:09:43,620 --> 00:09:46,100
Five special one-bite cutlet rice bowls?

169
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:47,680
Is a customer coming?

170
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:50,360
Still, I'm starving.

171
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:52,420
We're working hard
without even eating lunch.

172
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,280
A little something like
this is our rightful due

173
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:58,240
Delicious.

174
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,700
As expected of the special-use cutlet.

175
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:02,100
One more won't get noticed, right?

176
00:10:03,540 --> 00:10:05,440
Since we're at it, just a bit more.

177
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,000
Ate it, ate it all.

178
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:11,000
It really turned into a one-bite cutlet.

179
00:10:12,100 --> 00:10:12,860
Can't be helped.

180
00:10:12,860 --> 00:10:16,140
Let's cut the soup and cabbage
to match the amount of cutlet.

181
00:10:21,180 --> 00:10:22,520
The rice too!

182
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,000
Hey,

183
00:10:25,980 --> 00:10:33,120
so this is the real one-bite cutlet rice, the ultra-diet meal.
Considering the chief's pot belly, it's just right.

184
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:37,960
What a mouthy, reckless subordinate I am...
I'll just forget about it for a moment.

185
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:44,920
Uh-oh, the plate the chief treasured...

186
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:48,460
Can't be helped.
Let's cover it up with the yakisoba plate.

187
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:51,100
He won't notice for a while.

188
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,540
This is my letter of apology.

189
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:56,720
So you were hiding it here?

190
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:59,500
Let's get rid of it thoroughly.

191
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:02,980
Maybe there's something else in
here that was confiscated from me.

192
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:06,620
Uh-oh, he's back!

193
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:08,920
Me too.

194
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,620
Going out into the hallway now would be bad.

195
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:13,040
Let's just hide here for now.

196
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:15,920
This man is the biggest nuisance in our station,
you know.

197
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:19,880
I wish he'd just become a
restaurant employee for good.

198
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:22,580
Damn it, he had the nerve to call me a fool!

199
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:23,780
The delivery has arrived, you know.

200
00:11:23,780 --> 00:11:25,440
W-what's with this tiny portion?

201
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,720
This is Ryotsu's doing, isn't it?

202
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,980
Only that guy would pull
such a childish stunt.

203
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:32,720
The chief's Arita ware plate

204
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:35,420
has been swapped for a
delivery Chinese plate.

205
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:36,280
What?

206
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,200
We took it from there, though.

207
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:41,920
It was stored here.

208
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:43,060
Damn, there's nothing we can do.

209
00:11:44,860 --> 00:11:45,440
Who's there?

210
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,280
Is it Ryotsu?

211
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:48,700
Damn it, we're done for.

212
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:54,740
Ohara-kun.

213
00:11:54,740 --> 00:11:56,020
Are you all right, Ohara-kun?

214
00:11:56,020 --> 00:12:00,640
Running off to a place like that, so fast!

215
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:02,060
That Ryotsu bastard!

216
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:21,840
This spot is still the best, after all.

217
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:24,840
Is it really okay to be slacking off here,
Ryo-chan?

218
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:29,160
Working for nothing is ridiculous.
I'm not putting up with it.

219
00:12:29,820 --> 00:12:31,800
Here, I poured you some barley tea.

220
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:35,020
Sorry for making you go to so much trouble.

221
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:37,820
- A drink after work tastes so good. This is it.
- Hot, hot, hot.

222
00:12:37,820 --> 00:12:41,440
- Ai-chan, thanks for your hard work with the Katroll. Here you go.
- Thank you.

223
00:12:45,380 --> 00:12:48,420
Senpai, is it really all right?
Being here like this?

224
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:50,700
Nakagawa!

225
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:56,460
- It's not mine.
- It's not mine either.

226
00:12:56,860 --> 00:12:57,720
It's mine.

227
00:12:58,160 --> 00:13:00,680
Tch, collecting the plates is my job too

228
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,300
Ryo-san, out on another delivery again?

229
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:05,720
Must be nice, looking so busy.

230
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:06,900
Shut up!

231
00:13:06,900 --> 00:13:08,900
Honestly, what is this?

232
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,780
Leaving this much food behind like this.

233
00:13:11,780 --> 00:13:14,340
Try putting yourself in the shoes of
the person who has to collect this stuff!

234
00:13:15,900 --> 00:13:19,440
I'm only collecting the bowls, right?

235
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:28,700
You have to clean up after
yourself for what you leave behind.

236
00:13:31,140 --> 00:13:32,820
The importance of food!

237
00:13:32,940 --> 00:13:34,780
I'm telling you,
he's totally Yonpiru, you know.

238
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:44,340
What kind-hearted people there are.

239
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:48,960
Such thoughtful little touches really boost morale,
don't they?

240
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:55,000
Who the hell did this?

241
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,800
Wait, wait.

242
00:13:57,940 --> 00:14:00,960
Using a sacred bowl as an ashtray!

243
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:04,620
It was you!

244
00:14:04,940 --> 00:14:06,220
N-no, it wasn't me, Ryo-san.

245
00:14:07,020 --> 00:14:07,880
Come out!

246
00:14:07,980 --> 00:14:08,560
No, no.

247
00:14:11,780 --> 00:14:13,980
It wasn't me! It wasn't me! It was him, him!

248
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:15,700
Hey, you!

249
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:16,430
Ugh, so -

250
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:19,880
I'm sorry! Forgive me!
It was just a moment of weakness!

251
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:23,778
Your wicked deeds are rampant!
Even if the heavens forgive you,

252
00:14:23,828 --> 00:14:25,780
this Ryotsu won't forgive you!

253
00:14:26,280 --> 00:14:28,300
Aaaah! I'm sorry!

254
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:29,900
Ah, aaah!

255
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:32,700
Be more careful from now on.

256
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:34,780
Yes~

257
00:14:34,780 --> 00:14:36,160
Yes~

258
